        "title": "你 / 看: 看你X的/瞧他X的 evaluates a visible behavior",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "看你X的/瞧他X的 draws attention to visible behavior with an evaluation. It may be affectionate or critical according to context and tone.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "看你急的！",
                "pinyin": "kàn nǐ jí de ！",
                "meaning": "Look how anxious you are!",
                "audio": "964161de1ec300d9f17ac079cbaf42d9f696f1e7b5da21c4bcfb2f6b1d93a451"
              },
              {
                "text": "瞧他高兴的！",
